: HAND-MADE. Typed from Anthropic's documented web search error and pause shapes, NOT captured from a live account.
: Shape per platform.claude.com/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/web-search-tool ("Errors": a web_search_tool_result whose
: content is a single object {type: web_search_tool_result_error, error_code}, inside a 200 response) and
: platform.claude.com/docs/en/agents-and-tools/tool-use/server-tools ("pause_turn": the API can pause a long search turn and
: return stop_reason pause_turn, and the paused message is sent back unchanged). The error code used is one the page lists
: (too_many_requests). The streaming page shows result blocks arriving whole in a content_block_start.
: What this cannot witness: the live wire, or how often a real turn pauses.

